VALIDATION / ASSUMPTIONS
- Generalised cost = monetary cost + Value of Time × total door-to-door time.
- Baseline VOT = EUR 10/hour.
- Sensitivity scenarios = EUR 5, 10 and 20/hour.
- Private-car travel uses the observed 26 min driving time plus an explicit 10 min round-trip parking/access allowance.
- The private-car parking/access allowance corresponds to 5 min per direction for parking search and walking.
- Car sharing includes 5 min access/search per direction.
- Shared bike and shared scooter include 3 min access/search per direction.
- Scooter travel time is modelled at 15 km/h average operating speed.
- Taxi fare uses the midpoint of the observed EUR 10-16 one-way range.
- Taxi waiting time is an explicit 5 min per-direction assumption.
- Uber waiting time uses the observed 6 min outbound and 3 min return estimates.
- Public transport cost is the net annual subscription allocated over 150 university days.
- No additional PT waiting time is invented beyond the observed 23 min door-to-door itinerary per direction.

